---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pagination:
  data: locales
  size: 1
  alias: lang
permalink: "{{ '' if lang == 'ko' else 'en/' }}products-deck.html"
title: 목재덱
description: 교량 보도와 공원 산책로에 적용하는 하이탑 천연 목재덱 제품군입니다.
bodyClass: bg-surface text-ink
---

<section class="relative mt-20 h-[36vh] min-h-[280px] max-h-[380px] overflow-hidden bg-night">
  <img src="{{ '/images/hero/deck-hero.jpg' | lurl }}" alt="{{ '녹지 공간에 조성된 목재데크 산책로' | t }}"
       class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-[center_68%]" width="1920" height="1280" fetchpriority="high">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-night/45"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-44 bg-gradient-to-t from-night/70 to-transparent"></div>

  <div class="container-hi relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col justify-end pb-9 text-white sm:pb-11">
    <nav aria-label="{{ '브레드크럼' | t }}" class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-white/60">
      <a href="{{ '/' | lurl }}" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">{{ "홈" | t }}</a>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true">chevron_right</span>
      <span aria-current="page" class="text-white/90">{{ "목재덱" | t }}</span>
    </nav>
    <span class="eyebrow-line !text-white/60">Wood Deck</span>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white [text-shadow:0_2px_18px_rgba(11,14,19,0.45)] sm:text-4xl">{{ "목재덱" | t }}</h1>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="product-index" class="scroll-mt-20 border-b border-line bg-surface py-14 lg:py-20">
  <div class="container-hi">
    <div class="grid items-end gap-7 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <span class="eyebrow-line">Product Portfolio</span>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-4xl">{{ "공간의 쓰임에 맞춘 4개 수종 · 6개 모델" | t }}</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="border-t border-ink/15 pt-5 leading-relaxed text-secondary lg:col-span-5">
        {{ "교량 보도·공원 산책로·수변 공간의 조건을 고려해 수종을 선택할 수 있습니다. 수종별 원산지와 물성, 내구성 등급을 비교해 보세요." | t }}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid border-y border-ink/15 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {% for item in products.deck.compare %}
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 border-b border-line py-5 sm:odd:border-r sm:[&:nth-last-child(-n+2)]:border-b-0 lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r lg:odd:border-r lg:last:border-r-0 lg:px-6 lg:first:pl-0 lg:last:pr-0">
          <span class="font-display text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.18em] text-accent">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
          <div class="flex flex-1 items-baseline justify-between gap-3">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-extrabold text-ink">{{ item.name | t }}</h3>
            <span class="font-display text-[0.68rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-secondary">{{ item.grade }}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
      {% for w in products.deck.woods %}
        <article class="group overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-white ring-1 ring-line transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:ring-primary/20 hover:shadow-[0_18px_45px_rgba(25,28,29,0.10)]">
          <div class="relative h-60 overflow-hidden bg-section sm:h-64">
            <img src="{{ w.img | lurl }}" alt="{% if lang == 'en' %}{{ w.nameKo | t }} wood deck{% else %}{{ w.nameKo }} 목재덱{% endif %}"
                 class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-105"
                 loading="lazy" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-night/85 via-night/15 to-night/10"></div>
            <span class="absolute left-6 top-5 font-display text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-white/65">{{ w.num }}</span>
            <div class="absolute inset-x-6 bottom-5 flex items-end justify-between gap-4">
              <div>
                <p class="font-display text-[0.62rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.17em] text-white/55">{{ w.sub }}</p>
                <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-extrabold text-white">{{ w.nameKo | t }}</h3>
              </div>
              <span class="rounded-full border border-white/25 bg-night/25 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm">{{ w.origin | t }}</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-7 sm:p-8">
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-secondary">{{ w.desc | t }}</p>

            <dl class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 border-y border-ink/12 sm:grid-cols-4">
              {% for s in w.specs %}
                <div class="border-b border-line px-3 py-4 odd:border-r sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r sm:odd:border-r sm:last:border-r-0 sm:first:pl-0">
                  <dt class="font-display text-[0.58rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-secondary/65">{{ s.k | t }}</dt>
                  <dd class="mt-1.5 text-[0.8rem] font-bold text-ink">{{ s.v | t }}</dd>
                </div>
              {% endfor %}
            </dl>

            {% if w.models %}
              <div class="mt-6">
                <p class="font-display text-[0.6rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-secondary/65">Models</p>
                <div class="spec-table-wrap mt-3">
                  <table class="spec-table">
                    <thead>
                      <tr><th>{{ "모델명" | t }}</th><th>{{ "조달식별번호" | t }}</th><th>{{ "크기 (길이 × 폭 × 두께)" | t }}</th></tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                      {% for m in w.models %}
                        <tr>
                          <td class="font-bold">{{ m.model }}</td>
                          <td class="id-col">{{ m.code }}</td>
                          <td>{{ m.size }}</td>
                        </tr>
                      {% endfor %}
                    </tbody>
                  </table>
                </div>
                {% if w.usage %}
                  <p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-secondary">{{ "용도" | t }} — {{ w.usage | t }}</p>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            <div class="mt-5">
              {% for f in w.features %}
                <div class="grid grid-cols-[2rem_1fr] gap-2 border-t border-ink/10 py-3 {% if loop.last %}border-b{% endif %}">
                  <span class="font-display text-[0.62rem] font-bold text-accent">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
                  <p class="text-[0.8rem] leading-relaxed text-ink/75">{{ f | t }}</p>
                </div>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="border-b border-line bg-white py-14 lg:py-20">
  <div class="container-hi">
    <div class="grid items-end gap-7 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <span class="eyebrow-line">Installation Guide</span>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-4xl">{{ "시공 전 확인해야 할 기준" | t }}</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="border-t border-ink/15 pt-5 leading-relaxed text-secondary lg:col-span-5">
        {{ "목재의 움직임과 배수, 하부 구조를 함께 고려해야 안정적인 품질을 유지할 수 있습니다." | t }}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-x-10 md:grid-cols-3">
      {% for item in products.deck.install %}
        <article class="border-t border-ink/15 py-6 md:border-b">
          <span class="font-display text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.18em] text-accent">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
          <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-extrabold text-ink">{{ item.t | t }}</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-secondary">{{ item.d | t }}</p>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set ctaTitle = "목재덱 납품 문의" %}
{% set ctaDesc = "수종 선택과 규격, 수량을 알려주시면 현장 조건에 맞춰 검토해 드립니다." %}
{% set ctaSecondary = { label: "논슬립 보기", url: "/products-nonslip.html" } %}
{% include "partials/cta-band.njk" %}
